# Dxun, the jungle to Mandalore's camp (TSL, 402DXN, 403DXN): Colonel
# Tobin's scene sending a detachment to Dxun (cs_tob_1), the Mandalorian
# sentries at their barricade (asked what they do on Dxun, the Exile only
# exploring, "Lead on, then": no fight, no DSP), the walk into the camp
# (meetm_cs) and Mandalore: Onderon asked after, the price of passage
# (pricepassage) and his own test, the permacrete charges by the cache
# (explosivesit); Xarga's missing recruit (missingm: Kumus's gear, to be
# brought back) and the gate guard's zakkeg (zchallenge), taken.
# Starts from the jungle's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dxun_jungle data/routes/tsl/dxun_camp.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Dxun Jungle, Main Area" and "Mandalore"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the sealed cache by the dead Mandalorian (DxunCache_imp: Thorium
# charges from Dantooine or Korriban), Kex's store, Zuka's navigational
# telemetry (Repair, Computer and three Phase Pulse parts from random
# cannoks), the battle circle (five duels under rules: no weapons, no
# powers).
talk                 # Colonel Tobin's detachment (cs_tob_1)
say What are you doing on Dxun? # the sentries (no Kreia: E15)
say I was exploring. Who are you?
say Lead on, then.   # a_to_mandalore: 403DXN at WP_MEETMANDALORE
to TR_MEETMANDALORE
talk
module 403dxn
talk                 # the walk in (meetm_cs)
say I'm trying to get to Onderon, do you know how I can get there?
say How can I prove myself?
say So there's nothing you can think of? # the charges (a_es_start)
say I'll see what I can do.
talk                 # Mandalore (start 3)
say I might. Who are you? # Xarga's recruit
say Why do you want the body?
say If I find Kumus' body, I will bring back his gear.
use xarga
talk
say =Larger beasts?  # the gate guard (not "What did you mean by larger beasts?")
say What's a zakkeg?
say I can defeat it.
say We'll see. I'll be back after I've defeated one.
use g_gate_guard
talk
save dxun_tests
